{
  "comment": "Shape of the MX10004 hardware reference set for the transceiver subscription (nl6#771); hand-written from the issue, an authoring record, not an observation. Three notification shapes per transceiver. Hardware also emits oper-status alone under a .../state prefix from the same sensor; nl6 serves oper-status in the inventory notification and cannot emit a leaf the request path does not cover, so that third shape is not modelled.",
  "subtree": "transceiver",
  "prefixes": [
    "openconfig:/components/component[name=*]",
    "openconfig:/components/component[name=*]/transceiver"
  ],
  "notifications": 0,
  "extension": "juniper-header",
  "leaves": [
